n packages/api/test/drift-mcp-global-resolve.test.js: `const raw = request.headers['x-test-session-user'];`.,M,T4,DR0263,M,T4,False,,M,T4,HIGH,MEDIUM,YES,True,,False,False,False,True,E003 | E006,No mandatory D4 trigger; the exact blind-pass agreement is retained.,False,False,NEW_HOLDOUT,,,,,\nCROOT-00608-03,608,zts212653/clowder-ai,1,P6-PC-0019,Bug: MCP 管理页同步全部报 400 — projectPath 缺失,Implement the changed operation in packages/api/src/routes/agent-hooks.ts: `const validated = await validateProjectPath(rawPath);`.,M,T4,DR0327,M,T2,True,TIER_DISAGREEMENT,M,T1,HIGH,MEDIUM,YES,True,,True,True,False,True,E003 | E006 | E041 | E007,\"The changed route directly invokes the pre-existing validateProjectPath helper visible in the true-base repository context. That is direct local reuse/near-copy, so the adjudicated tier is T1 rather than the broader T2/T4 labels.\",False,False,NEW_HOLDOUT,,,,,\nCROOT-00629-01,629,ZHANGTIANYAO1/teamspeak-music-bot,1,P6-PC-0020,[Feature Request] 希望能增加对 Spotify 音频源的支持 / Support for Spotify audio source,Implement the changed operation in src/music/spotify/spotify-oauth.ts: `for (let i = 0; i < 64; i++) out += PKCE_CHARS[bytes[i] % PKCE_CHARS.length];`.,M,T4,DR0231,M,T4,False,,M,T4,HIGH,MEDIUM,YES,True,,False,False,False,True,E003 | E006,No mandatory D4 trigger; the exact blind-pass agreement is retained.,True,True,DISCOVERY_DERIVED,G629-01,Exact,T5,Pilot,Core 52\nCROOT-00629-02,629,ZHANGTIANYAO1/teamspeak-music-bot,1,P6-PC-0021,[Feature Request] 希望能增加对 Spotify 音频源的支持 / Support for Spotify audio source,\"Write filesystem content in src/music/spotify/controller.ts using the changed operation writeFileSync(this.file, JSON.stringify(t), { mode: 0o600 });\",M,T4,DR0291,M,T4,False,,M,T4,HIGH,MEDIUM,YES,True,,False,False,False,True,E003 | E006,No mandatory D4 trigger; the exact blind-pass agreement is retained.,False,False,NEW_HOLDOUT,,,,,\nCROOT-00629-03,629,ZHANGTIANYAO1/teamspeak-music-bot,1,P6-PC-0022,[Feature Request] 希望能增加对 Spotify 音频源的支持 / Support for Spotify audio source,\"Write filesystem content in src/music/spotify/controller.test.ts using the changed operation writeFileSync(existingBin, \"\"#!/bin/sh\\n\"\");\",M,T4,DR0218,M,T2,True,TIER_DISAGREEMENT,M,T4,HIGH,MEDIUM,YES,True,,False,False,False,True,E003 | E006,\"After reviewing the underlying pre-change packet, Pass A's T4 classification is retained. The task, API, test, or nearby implementation context makes this mechanism understandable, but the visible chronology-safe evidence does not specifically select it and no direct/strong local precedent is established in this pass.\",False,False,NEW_HOLDOUT,,,,,\nCROOT-00629-04,629,ZHANGTIANYAO1/teamspeak-music-bot,1,P6-PC-0023,[Feature Request] 希望能增加对 Spotify 音频源的支持 / Support for Spotify audio source,\"Write filesystem content in src/music/spotify/go-librespot.ts using the changed operation writeFileSync(posixPath.join(this.opts.configDir, \"\"config.yml\"\"), yml, \"\"utf8\"\");\",M,T4,DR0079,M,T4,False,,M,T4,HIGH,MEDIUM,YES,True,,False,False,False,True,E003 | E006,No mandatory D4 trigger; the exact blind-pass agreement is retained.,False,False,NEW_HOLDOUT,,,,,\nCROOT-00629-05,629,ZHANGTIANYAO1/teamspeak-music-bot,1,P6-PC-0024,[Feature Request] 希望能增加对 Spotify 音频源的支持 / Support for Spotify audio source,\"Implement the changed operation in src/web/api/spotify.ts: `router.get(\"\"/login\"\", requirePermission(\"\"platform.auth\"\"), (_req, res) => {`.\",M,T2,DR0049,M,T4,True,TIER_DISAGREEMENT,M,T2,HIGH,MEDIUM,YES,True,,False,True,False,True,E003 | E006 | E018,\"After reviewing the underlying pre-change packet, Pass A's T2 classification is retained. Chronology-safe project-local evidence shows a materially equivalent repository pattern/architecture (RAW_PC_CONTEXT:CHANGE_01:repo_search_hits.tsv) that strongly points toward this mechanism, without establishing a direct near-copy.\",False,False,NEW_HOLDOUT,,,,,\nCROOT-00629-06,629,ZHANGTIANYAO1/teamspeak-music-bot,1,P6-PC-0025,[Feature Request] 希望能增加对 Spotify 音频源